+REM   run_intg.bat --panic   构建 panic-test 变体：A-F 后触发 panic，验证故障停机
+REM   run_intg.bat --rebuild 强制重新构建 Rust app
+REM
+REM 前置:
+REM   - build_rel\stm32f407_minimal.elf (firmware, 已含 RUSTDIAG)
